    "prompt": "The play-of-colour in a black opal: flashes of spectral green, blue and flame red shifting in patches as if the stone were slowly turned under a light, deep black between them. Make it striking on a big projected wall in a dark room: a bold composition, rich colour against real blacks, depth, glow, and motion that reads from across the room. Keep a demoscener's economy: lookup tables and fixed-size buffers kept in room.state, low-resolution offscreen buffers for any per-pixel work, nothing allocated inside hot loops, a steady 60fps at 1920x1080, and compact, clearly named code.",
